

**10. Bessel Functions of Fractional Order**

**Mathematical Properties**

**10.1. Spherical Bessel Functions**

**Definitions**

**Differential Equation**

**10.1.1**

\(\begin{array}{l}2^{a}w^{\prime}+2zw^{\prime}+[z^{s}-n(n+1)]w=0\\ (n=0,\pm 1,\,\pm 2,\ldots)\end{array}\)****

**Representations by Elementary Functions**

**10.1.8**

\(\begin{array}{l}j_{n}(z)=\sqrt{\frac{3}{2\pi}/\!z}J_{n+1}(z),\end{array}\)****

**the** _Spherical Bessel functions of the second kind_****

\(\begin{array}{l}y_{n}(z)=\sqrt{\frac{3}{2\pi}/\!z}Y_{n+1}(z),\end{array}\)****

**and the** _Spherical Bessel functions of the third kind_****

\(\begin{array}{l}h_{n}^{(1)}(z)=j_{n}(z)+iy_{n}(z)=\sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi/\!z}}H _{n+1}^{(1)}(z),\end{array}\)****

\(\begin{array}{l}h_{n}^{(2)}(z)=j_{n}(z)-iy_{n}(z)=\sqrt{\frac{1}{2\pi/\!z}}H _{n+1}^{(2)}(z).\end{array}\)****

**The pairs** \(j_{n}(z),\;y_{n}(z)\) **and** \(h_{n}^{(1)}(z),\;h_{n}^{(2)}(z)\) **are linearly independent solutions for every** \(n\)**. For general properties see the remarks after 9.1.1.**

**Algorithm Series (See 9.1.2, 9.1.10)**

**10.1.2**

\(\begin{array}{l}\underline{z^{n}}=\frac{z^{n}}{1\cdot 3\cdot 5\ldots(2n+1)} \biggl{\{}1-\frac{\frac{1}{2}z^{2}}{1!(2n+3)}\\ +\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z^{2})^{3}}{2!(2n+3)(2n+5)}-\ldots\biggr{\}}\end{array}\)****

**10.1.3**

\(\begin{array}{l}y_{n}(z)=\!-\frac{1\cdot 3\cdot 5\ldots(2n-1)}{z^{n+1}} \biggl{\{}1-\frac{\frac{1}{2}z^{2}}{1!(1-2n)}\\ +\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z^{2})^{3}}{2!(1-2n)(3-2n)}-\ldots\biggr{\}}\end{array}\)****

**Limiting Values as** \(z\to 0\)****

**10.1.4**

\(\begin{array}{l}z^{-n}j_{n}(z)\rightarrow\frac{1}{1\cdot 3\cdot 5\ldots(2n+1)} \end{array}\)****

**10.1.5**

\(\begin{array}{l}z^{n+1}y_{n}(z)\rightarrow\!-1\cdot 3\cdot 5\ldots(2n-1)\end{array}\)****

**10.1.6**

\(\begin{array}{l}W\{j_{n}(z),\;y_{n}(z)\}=z^{-2}\\ 10.1.7\\ W\{h_{n}^{(1)}(z),\;h_{n}^{(2)}(z)\}=-2i z^{-2}\end{array}\)****

**Representations by Elementary Functions**

**10.1.8**

\(\begin{array}{l}j_{n}(z)=z^{-1}[P(n+\frac{1}{2},\,z)\,\sin\,(z-\frac{1}{2}n \pi)\\ +Q(n+\frac{1}{2},\,z)\,\cos\,(z-\frac{1}{2}n\pi)]\\ 10.1.9\\ y_{n}(z)=(-1)^{*+1}z^{-1}[P(n+\frac{1}{2},z)\,\cos\,(z+\frac{1}{2}n\pi)\\ -Q(n+\frac{1}{2},\,z)\,\sin\,(z+\frac{1}{2}n\pi)]\\ P\left(n+\frac{1}{2},\,z\right)=1-\frac{(n+2)!}{2!\,\Gamma(n-1)}\,(2z)^{-2}\\ +\frac{(n+4)!}{4!\,\Gamma